保持不变”的依次追及关系。</p>\n\n        <p class=\"blue\">\n          例：A步行速度为60米/分，A过完红绿灯后5分钟开始负重[illegible]，1路公交车追上他，<br>\n          <span class=\"indent\">而每隔10分钟就有一辆迎面开来的1路公交车相遇。求1路公交车间</span><br>\n          <span class=\"indent\">隔发车的时间。</span>\n        </p>\n\n        <p class=\"analysis\">\n          <span class=\"red\">分析：</span>\n          <span class=\"red\">无论是在后面开来的，还是迎面开来的，都是1路公交车，即：车间距</span>\n        </p>\n        <p class=\"relationship\">保持相等。</p>\n\n        <p class=\"numbered\">\n          <span class=\"number\">②</span>\n          <span class=\"red\">“从后面追来的”</span>\n          <span class=\"blue\">：人车同向，$S_{\\text{差}}=\\text{车间距}=V_{\\text{差}}\\times\\text{追及间隔}$</span>\n        </p>\n\n        <div class=\"formula-block\">\n          <div class=\"formula-row\">\n            <span class=\"label red\">有追关系 ← 相等</span>\n            <span class=\"equation\">$=(V_{\\text{车}}-60)\\times15$</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"formula-row\">\n            <span class=\"label\"></span>\n            <span class=\"equation\">$=15(V_{\\text{车}}-60)$</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <p class=\"numbered\">\n          <span class=\"number\">③</span>\n          <span class=\"red\">“迎面相遇的”</span>\n          <span class=\"blue\">：人车相向，$S_{\\text{和}}=\\text{车间距}=(V_{\\text{车}}+60)\\times10$</span>\n        </p>\n\n        <div class=\"formula-block\" style=\"margin-top:-1px;\">\n          <div class=\"formula-row\">\n            <span class=\"label\"></span>\n            <span class=\"equation\">$=10(V_{\\text{车}}+60)$</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <p class=\"blue\">解：设1路公交车的速度为$x$米/分，根据路程数量关系，有：</p>\n\n        <div class=\"working\">\n          <div>$15(x-60)=10(x+60)$</div>\n          <div>$15x-900=10x+600$</div>\n          <div>$15x-10x=600+900$</div>\n          <div>$5x=1500$</div>\n          <div>$x=300$</div>\n        </div>\n\n        <p class=\"blue\">即：1路公交车的速度为300米/分。</p>\n        <p class=\"blue\">车间距：$15\\times(300-60)=3600$（米）　或　$10\\times(300+60)=3600$（米）</p>\n        <p>\n          <span class=\"blue\">相邻发车</span>\n          <span class=\"red\">车间距 $=V_{\\text{车}}\\cdot t_{\\text{发车间隔}}$</span>\n          <span class=\"blue\">可得：</span>\n        </p>\n        <p class=\"indent-wide blue\">$t_{\\text{发车间隔}}=\\text{车间距}\\div V_{\\text{车}}=3600\\div300=12$（分）</p>\n        <p class=\"answer blue\">答：1路公交车的发车时间间隔为12分钟。</p>\n      </section>\n\n      <section class=\"section second\">\n        <span class=\"star\">★</span>\n\n        <p class=\"red\">\n          若题中只给时间、速度的倍数，则设比较小的速度为$a$，再根据路程\n        </p>\n        <p class=\"red\">数量关系表示其他量来解题。</p>\n\n        <p class=\"blue\">\n          （不建议设较小的速度为“1”，设$a$更有说<br>\n          服力。最后$a$被抵消时，才能更直观的看出与“$a$”无关）\n        </p>\n\n        <p class=\"blue\">\n          例：A在B路上骑车时，发现每隔9分钟有[illegible]车从后面追上他，A<br>\n          <span class=\"indent\">按原速度[illegible]行驶后，每隔9分钟骑车与[illegible]相遇，已</span><br>\n          <span class=\"indent\">知[illegible]车的速度为骑车速度的5倍。若公交车的发车时间间隔相</span><br>\n          <span class=\"indent\">同，求比较慢车间隔的时间。</span>\n        </p>\n\n        <p class=\"small\">\n          <span class=\"red\">分析：① 公交车　骑车的A：二者同向 → 路程差为车间距。</span>\n        </p>\n      </section>\n    </article>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
